  "title": "THE CATO CORPORATION ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND",
  "summary": "CHARLOTTE, N.C. , Aug. 30, 2024 /PRNewswire/ -- The Board of Directors of The Cato Corporation (NYSE: CATO) declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.17 per share. The dividend will be payable on September 30, 2024 to shareholders of record on September 16, 2024 .",
